{"id":"0c16017ee3d857fa","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-coded-omega-model.md","title":"Countable Coded Omega Model","display":"df-coded-omega-model — Countable Coded Omega Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-coded-omega-model","aliases":["62-df-coded-omega-model"],"display":"df-coded-omega-model — Countable Coded Omega Model","depends_on":["[[62-df-coded-function]]","[[62-df-omega-model]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §VII.2; §§VIII.1–VIII.2","source_pages":[248,249,312,314],"source_pdf_pages":[266,267,330,332]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-coded-omega-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-coded-omega-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-coded-omega-model — Countable Coded Omega Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" href=\"?note=5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" title=\"62-df-omega-model\">62-df-omega-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §VII.2; §§VIII.1–VIII.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>248</span><span>249</span><span>312</span><span>314</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>266</span><span>267</span><span>330</span><span>332</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(W\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，数值截面见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>；ω 模型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" href=\"?note=5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" title=\"62-df-omega-model\">62-df-omega-model</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span> 句子集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coded\\text{-}omega\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\mathcal S_W\\coloneqq\\{(W)_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal M_W\\coloneqq\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S_W},\\quad\n\\mathsf{CodedOmegaModel}(W,T)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_W,T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coded\\text{-}omega\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\mathcal S_W\\coloneqq\\{(W)_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal M_W\\coloneqq\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S_W},\\quad\n\\mathsf{CodedOmegaModel}(W,T)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_W,T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>重复截面允许；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\varnothing\">\\(W=\\varnothing\\)</span> 仍编码非空域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>，但它不因此成为 RCA₀ 的模型。本定义的全理论满足在元层解释；在弱对象理论中声称 CodedOmegaModel(W,T) 可由一个真值集判定时，还需对应公式的 valuation/满足编码，不能自动沿用外部真值谓词。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§VII.2; §§VIII.1–VIII.2；纸面页 248, 249, 312, 314；PDF 页 266, 267, 330, 332。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-omega-model","status":"resolved","id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-omega-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，数值截面见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；ω 模型见 [[62-df-omega-model]]。$T$ 是 $L_2$ 句子集合。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-omega-model","status":"resolved","id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，数值截面见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；ω 模型见 [[62-df-omega-model]]。$T$ 是 $L_2$ 句子集合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"L_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coded\\text{-}omega\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\mathcal S_W\\coloneqq\\{(W)_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal M_W\\coloneqq\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S_W},\\quad\n\\mathsf{CodedOmegaModel}(W,T)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_W,T).","display":true},{"tex":"W=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\varnothing\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1429,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-omega-model|Countable Coded Omega Model]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-omega-model]]"}],"outgoing":["c156c03daff0aff0","5ed7a378ff9d39c6"]}